@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
title TASK-260715-111tde — Relay identity and session establishment

actor "ReluxTunnelCore\nrelay coordinator" as Client
participant "SSHTransport" as SSH
participant "Verified relux-relay" as Relay
participant "Relay protocol v1\nsession state" as Session

autonumber

== Bounded identity preflight ==
Client -> SSH: openExecChannel("<path> ~--identity ~--protocol 1")
SSH -> Relay: authenticated exec
Relay --> SSH: one canonical JSON line (<= 512 bytes) + EOF + exit 0
SSH --> Client: bounded stdout, separate stderr, SSHExecExit
Client -> Client: compare version/commit/platform/selfSha256\nwith signed manifest

alt mismatch, extra bytes, invalid record, timeout, or nonzero exit
  Client -> SSH: reset/close identity channel
  Client -> Client: stable degraded capability reason
else identity accepted
  == Long-lived framed channel ==
  Client -> SSH: openExecChannel("<path> ~--stdio ~--protocol 1")
  SSH -> Relay: authenticated exec; stdout is protocol-only
  Client -> Relay: client hello (12 bytes)
  Relay -> Relay: validate fixed fields and local caps\nbefore body-sized allocation
  Relay --> Client: server hello (16 bytes)
  Client -> Client: validate status, selected features, maxFrame,\nand TASK-260715-18owh7 effective limits

  alt invalid hello, limit, EOF, timeout, cancellation, or lane loss
    Client -> SSH: reset/close channel
    Relay -> Relay: retire generation and all associations once
  else current generation accepted
    Client -> Session: publish usable RelaySession
    loop bounded multiplexed operation
      Client <-> Relay: framed control/DNS/ordinary messages\nwith partial I/O and bounded queues
    end
    Client -> Relay: CLOSE_SESSION or EOF
    Relay --> Client: CLOSE_SESSION / exit metadata
    Client -> SSH: idempotent bounded close
  end
end

note over Client,Relay
No SFTP. Stderr never enters the framed decoder.
No session is published before identity and hello validation.
end note
@enduml
